<h2>Summary</h2>
<p>AI ad copy homogenization stems from AI executing "averaging" tasks, while advertising effectiveness hinges on "differentiated recall." The solution isn't finding smarter AI, but:</p>
<ol>
<li>Replace vague directions with specific restrictions</li>
<li>Externalize brand differentiation rules</li>
<li>Use process management to prevent duplication</li>
<li>Preserve human judgment nodes in human-AI collaboration</li>
</ol>
<p>If you're struggling with AI copy homogenization, <strong>fix the prompt first, consider switching tools second</strong>.</p>
